# Pijin - Monorepo Environment Configuration Template
#
# Pijin consists of multiple apps requiring environment configuration:
#
# 1. Backend & Landing Page API (apps/backend):
#    Copy apps/backend/.env.example to apps/backend/.env
#    Includes Database URL, Stellar Keys, Soroban RPC, Upstash QStash, and Textbee SMS gateway.
#
# 2. Mobile App (apps/mobile):
#    Copy apps/mobile/.env.example to apps/mobile/.env
#    Includes Expo public variables, WalletConnect ID, and Stellar Testnet endpoints.
#
# Refer to the specific sub-app .env.example files for detailed parameter descriptions.
